Report (com.acme.reports): Kick-off of the billing migration
	Title: Kick-off of the billing migration
	Date: 2026-03-02
	Author: Ana García
	Status: Final
	Summary >>
		The team agreed to move invoicing to the new service before the summer.
		Payments stay on the legacy system until the reconciliation job is ready.
	Section:
		Title: Scope
		Content >>
			Only invoicing moves in the first phase. Credit notes and refunds follow
			once the reconciliation job runs nightly without manual fixes.
	Section:
		Title: Risks
		Content >>
			The legacy export has no test coverage; any change there needs a manual
			check against last month's figures.
	Action:
		Owner: Luis Moreno
		Due: 2026-03-16
		Description >>
			Write the reconciliation job and run it against February's data.
	Action:
		Owner: Ana García
		Description >>
			Schedule the review with finance once the first run is clean.
